WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.270
A church.

2
00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:03.470
A bride and groom at the altar.

3
00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.820
Guests on every bench.

4
00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:07.720
Then the groom turns away.

5
00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.940
The bride sinks to the floor.

6
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:12.560
Every head in the church turns.

7
00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:16.180
One act later, the same two
stand at another wedding.

8
00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.550
This time, the bride is veiled.

9
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.380
Refused in Act 4.

10
00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:22.220
Married in Act 5.

11
00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:24.720
So does Claudio deserve her?

12
00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:27.670
In this mission, you'll
see how the match was made,

13
00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:29.680
mostly by other people.

14
00:00:29.730 --> 00:00:34.160
It starts with one look: "Can
the world buy such a jewel?"

15
00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:37.090
You'll pick apart Claudio's
accusation at the altar,

16
00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:38.730
in front of everyone.

17
00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:41.930
And you'll weigh the case
for him, and against.

18
00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:46.120
Your mission: decide whether
Claudio deserves Hero at the end.
